<h2 data-section-id=3D"foxhdn" data-start=3D"7505" data-end=3D"7545">3. UI =
state model (stores &amp; contexts)</h2>
<p data-start=3D"7547" data-end=3D"7708">For a non=E2=80=91cloud local appl=
ication, you should centralise state management to avoid prop drilling and =
ensure persistence across sessions.  A recommended model is:</p>
<h3 data-section-id=3D"uaikg3" data-start=3D"7710" data-end=3D"7752">3.1 Au=
thentication store (<code data-start=3D"7740" data-end=3D"7751">AuthStore</=
code>)</h3>
<ul data-start=3D"7754" data-end=3D"8022">
<li data-section-id=3D"1be1mfj" data-start=3D"7754" data-end=3D"7789">
<p data-start=3D"7756" data-end=3D"7789">Holds <code data-start=3D"7762" da=
ta-end=3D"7768">user</code> info and JWT tokens.</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id=3D"ljx50c" data-start=3D"7790" data-end=3D"7860">
<p data-start=3D"7792" data-end=3D"7860">Provides methods <code data-start=
=3D"7809" data-end=3D"7829">login(credentials)</code>, <code data-start=3D"=
7831" data-end=3D"7841">logout()</code>, <code data-start=3D"7843" data-end=
=3D"7859">refreshToken()</code>.</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id=3D"ksvupf" data-start=3D"7861" data-end=3D"7959">
<p data-start=3D"7863" data-end=3D"7959">Persists tokens and user info to <=
code data-start=3D"7896" data-end=3D"7910">localStorage</code> or <code dat=
a-start=3D"7914" data-end=3D"7925">IndexedDB</code> so that reloads keep th=
e session.</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id=3D"hv5cn5" data-start=3D"7960" data-end=3D"8022">
<p data-start=3D"7962" data-end=3D"8022">Emits auth state changes so that <=
code data-start=3D"7995" data-end=3D"8011">ProtectedRoute</code> can react.=
</p>
</li>
</ul>
