<p data-start=3D"9559" data-end=3D"9685">Many computed values (e.g., occupa=
ncy rate, open tasks, overdue charges) should be derived from base entity s=
tores and cached:</p>
<ul data-start=3D"9687" data-end=3D"9926">
<li data-section-id=3D"fw792p" data-start=3D"9687" data-end=3D"9738">
<p data-start=3D"9689" data-end=3D"9738"><strong data-start=3D"9689" data-e=
nd=3D"9706">occupancyRate</strong> =3D occupied units =C3=B7 total units.</=
p>
</li>
<li data-section-id=3D"1gk3dh8" data-start=3D"9739" data-end=3D"9812">
<p data-start=3D"9741" data-end=3D"9812"><strong data-start=3D"9741" data-e=
nd=3D"9758">tenantBalance</strong> =3D sum of unpaid rent charges =E2=80=93=
 payments for a tenant.</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id=3D"1ssz207" data-start=3D"9813" data-end=3D"9926">
<p data-start=3D"9815" data-end=3D"9926"><strong data-start=3D"9815" data-e=
nd=3D"9840">statementCompleteness</strong> =3D check if all required meters=
/readings and prepayments exist for a statement period.</p>
</li>
</ul>
<p data-start=3D"9928" data-end=3D"10001">You can implement derived selecto=
rs as React hooks or part of each store.</p>
