<h2 data-section-id=3D"1tudly4" data-start=3D"24454" data-end=3D"24474">Wha=
t this changes</h2>
<p data-start=3D"24476" data-end=3D"24533">This batch gives you the first <=
strong data-start=3D"24507" data-end=3D"24532">real functional spine</stron=
g>:</p>
<ul data-start=3D"24534" data-end=3D"24860">
<li data-section-id=3D"kltsvo" data-start=3D"24534" data-end=3D"24601">
<p data-start=3D"24536" data-end=3D"24601">stores now call feature-specific=
 adapters instead of placeholders</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id=3D"18lltxp" data-start=3D"24602" data-end=3D"24644">
<p data-start=3D"24604" data-end=3D"24644">exports are routed through the A=
PI layer</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id=3D"4lg9f4" data-start=3D"24645" data-end=3D"24737">
<p data-start=3D"24647" data-end=3D"24737">statement validation, preview, d=
raft creation, and finalization have concrete client calls</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id=3D"e311jy" data-start=3D"24738" data-end=3D"24777">
<p data-start=3D"24740" data-end=3D"24777">payment matching has a UI entry =
point</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id=3D"mswust" data-start=3D"24778" data-end=3D"24860">
<p data-start=3D"24780" data-end=3D"24860">object creation has a domain-spe=
cific modal instead of only generic field arrays</p>
</li>
</ul>
<h2 data-section-id=3D"1o6iiu3" data-start=3D"24862" data-end=3D"24887">Bes=
t next continuation</h2>
<p data-start=3D"24889" data-end=3D"24914">The next useful batch is:</p>
<ul data-start=3D"24915" data-end=3D"25127">
<li data-section-id=3D"1viwq58" data-start=3D"24915" data-end=3D"24936">
<p data-start=3D"24917" data-end=3D"24936"><code data-start=3D"24917" data-=
end=3D"24936">UnitFormModal.jsx</code></p>
</li>
<li data-section-id=3D"16jvtw0" data-start=3D"24937" data-end=3D"24961">
<p data-start=3D"24939" data-end=3D"24961"><code data-start=3D"24939" data-=
end=3D"24961">TenancyFormModal.jsx</code></p>
</li>
<li data-section-id=3D"1vqmbuj" data-start=3D"24962" data-end=3D"24988">
<p data-start=3D"24964" data-end=3D"24988"><code data-start=3D"24964" data-=
end=3D"24988">RecordPaymentModal.jsx</code></p>
</li>
<li data-section-id=3D"133tjda" data-start=3D"24989" data-end=3D"25040">
<p data-start=3D"24991" data-end=3D"25040"><code data-start=3D"24991" data-=
end=3D"25001">useToast</code> integration for success/error feedback</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id=3D"1s5utsv" data-start=3D"25041" data-end=3D"25127">
<p data-start=3D"25043" data-end=3D"25127">one <strong data-start=3D"25047"=
 data-end=3D"25078">end-to-end page integration</strong> for <code data-sta=
rt=3D"25083" data-end=3D"25101">RentOverviewPage</code> with <code data-sta=
rt=3D"25107" data-end=3D"25127">PaymentMatchDialog</code></p>
</li>
</ul>
<p data-start=3D"25129" data-end=3D"25215">That will complete the first ope=
rational workflow rather than just the structural one.</p>
