<p data-start=3D"35851" data-end=3D"35964">At this point the frontend has m=
oved from generic scaffolding to a fairly coherent local-first operational =
shell:</p>
<ul data-start=3D"35965" data-end=3D"36301">
<li data-section-id=3D"1vfjagl" data-start=3D"35965" data-end=3D"36076">
<p data-start=3D"35967" data-end=3D"36076">statements can be assembled with=
 units, cost lines, allocation weights, validation, preview, and finalizati=
on</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id=3D"170ob52" data-start=3D"36077" data-end=3D"36148">
<p data-start=3D"36079" data-end=3D"36148">documents can be previewed, clas=
sified, selected in bulk, and removed</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id=3D"14n52w9" data-start=3D"36149" data-end=3D"36210">
<p data-start=3D"36151" data-end=3D"36210">bookings support category preset=
s and receipt attachment UI</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id=3D"1itvlfa" data-start=3D"36211" data-end=3D"36244">
<p data-start=3D"36213" data-end=3D"36244">contacts have a real edit cycle<=
/p>
</li>
<li data-section-id=3D"1j33vwp" data-start=3D"36245" data-end=3D"36301">
<p data-start=3D"36247" data-end=3D"36301">repeated select logic is central=
ized in <code data-start=3D"36287" data-end=3D"36301">EntityPicker</code></=
p>
</li>
</ul>
<p data-start=3D"36303" data-end=3D"36375">The best next continuation is to=
 tighten the remaining domain mechanics:</p>
<ul data-start=3D"36376" data-end=3D"36649">
<li data-section-id=3D"17kamsu" data-start=3D"36376" data-end=3D"36447">
<p data-start=3D"36378" data-end=3D"36447"><code data-start=3D"36378" data-=
end=3D"36399">StatementWizardPage</code> consumption-based allocation with =
meter linkage</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id=3D"zmm5bm" data-start=3D"36448" data-end=3D"36490">
<p data-start=3D"36450" data-end=3D"36490"><code data-start=3D"36450" data-=
end=3D"36465">DocumentsPage</code> true bulk classify modal</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id=3D"1o256wp" data-start=3D"36491" data-end=3D"36543">
<p data-start=3D"36493" data-end=3D"36543"><code data-start=3D"36493" data-=
end=3D"36507">BookingsPage</code> backed by a real bookings store/api</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id=3D"1lv87jt" data-start=3D"36544" data-end=3D"36596">
<p data-start=3D"36546" data-end=3D"36596"><code data-start=3D"36546" data-=
