<p data-start=3D"31233" data-end=3D"31353">At this point the frontend archi=
tecture is no longer just page-complete; it has the beginnings of real doma=
in workflows:</p>
<ul data-start=3D"31354" data-end=3D"31748">
<li data-section-id=3D"14fu8e5" data-start=3D"31354" data-end=3D"31462">
<p data-start=3D"31356" data-end=3D"31462">statement wizard supports unit i=
nclusion, cost lines, custom weights, and meter-linked consumption mapping<=
/p>
</li>
<li data-section-id=3D"1ozap7b" data-start=3D"31463" data-end=3D"31533">
<p data-start=3D"31465" data-end=3D"31533">documents support preview, bulk =
selection, bulk classify, and delete</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id=3D"ayr5ti" data-start=3D"31534" data-end=3D"31595">
<p data-start=3D"31536" data-end=3D"31595">finance has concrete bookings/in=
voices store and API layers</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id=3D"epi3vu" data-start=3D"31596" data-end=3D"31655">
<p data-start=3D"31598" data-end=3D"31655">contacts and meters have proper =
create/edit capture flows</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id=3D"nvog4z" data-start=3D"31656" data-end=3D"31748">
<p data-start=3D"31658" data-end=3D"31748">the backend schema shape is expl=
icit and aligned with the DTOs and route/store assumptions</p>
</li>
</ul>
<p data-start=3D"31750" data-end=3D"31820">The strongest next continuation =
is to produce one of these two things:</p>
