<h2 data-section-id=3D"7wxjh8" data-start=3D"34851" data-end=3D"34872">J. W=
hat to do next</h2>
<p data-start=3D"34874" data-end=3D"34901">At this point you now have:</p>
<ul data-start=3D"34903" data-end=3D"35223">
<li data-section-id=3D"xerq7m" data-start=3D"34903" data-end=3D"34982">
<p data-start=3D"34905" data-end=3D"34982">a <strong data-start=3D"34907" d=
ata-end=3D"34938">frontend consolidation plan</strong> with exact file targ=
ets and migration order</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id=3D"1dnckrd" data-start=3D"34983" data-end=3D"35079">
<p data-start=3D"34985" data-end=3D"35079">a <strong data-start=3D"34987" d=
ata-end=3D"35037">backend controller/service/repository skeleton</strong> t=
hat matches the frontend DTOs and routes</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id=3D"1s5j2kc" data-start=3D"35080" data-end=3D"35115">
<p data-start=3D"35082" data-end=3D"35115">a <strong data-start=3D"35084" d=
ata-end=3D"35115">payments/rent matching path</strong></p>
</li>
<li data-section-id=3D"833mg2" data-start=3D"35116" data-end=3D"35170">
<p data-start=3D"35118" data-end=3D"35170">a <strong data-start=3D"35120" d=
ata-end=3D"35170">statement validation/preview/finalization path</strong></=
p>
</li>
<li data-section-id=3D"s7wb8g" data-start=3D"35171" data-end=3D"35223">
<p data-start=3D"35173" data-end=3D"35223">a <strong data-start=3D"35175" d=
ata-end=3D"35197">SQLite schema base</strong> aligned to the current UI</p>
</li>
</ul>
<p data-start=3D"35225" data-end=3D"35315">The highest-value next move is t=
o turn this from draft to executable by generating either:</p>
<ol data-start=3D"35316" data-end=3D"35438">
<li data-section-id=3D"1ly7erq" data-start=3D"35316" data-end=3D"35358">
<p data-start=3D"35319" data-end=3D"35358">a <strong data-start=3D"35321" d=
ata-end=3D"35354">repo-ready frontend patch set</strong>, or</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id=3D"1k4kdoy" data-start=3D"35359" data-end=3D"35438">
<p data-start=3D"35362" data-end=3D"35438">a <strong data-start=3D"35364" d=
ata-end=3D"35394">repo-ready backend starter</strong> with actual Express f=
iles and <code data-start=3D"35425" data-end=3D"35437">schema.sql</code>.</=
p>
</li>
</ol>
<p data-start=3D"35440" data-end=3D"35463">The best sequencing is:</p>
