only-node=3D"">
<li data-section-id=3D"i27hfu" data-start=3D"35464" data-end=3D"35507">
<p data-start=3D"35466" data-end=3D"35507">first generate the backend start=
er files,</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id=3D"1kczlcb" data-start=3D"35508" data-end=3D"35574" dat=
a-is-last-node=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"35510" data-end=3D"35574" data-is-last-node=3D"">then bind=
 the frontend API client against that concrete backend.</p>
</li>
